Cross-check: Revenue $14,419.48 − Expenses $15,346.61 = Net **−$927.13**.

## Inclusion rules (same as `calculateBusinessMetrics` / `isPlExpenseDebit`)

- Include: `EXPENSE_*` (and `CASH_EXPENSE_*`) business debits
- Exclude: personal dept, director loan / `NON_TAXABLE_DIRECTOR_REIMBURSEMENT`, ATO GST refund (not an expense)
- GST-free bank fee (NAB Intnl Tran Fee) **stays** in BANK FEES on P&L; only excluded from 1B

